0,Comments=The USS Washington CVN-73 is cruising in the North Arabian Sea when Russia decides it's had enough of the current oil embargo and launches a MASSIVE anti-ship and anti-AWACS strike against the CSG. The Washington is now protected by DDGs and a CG.
